version 0.9.2
module charger-power

# The BQ24610 charge and power path (datasheet SLUS892D Figure 20): 19V adapter, 3-cell Li-ion
# (12.6V), 4A adapter limit, 3A charge, 0.3A precharge/termination, 5-hour safety timer.
#
# The module owns its refdes and net names; the board reaches it through its ports
# (spec/module.md §3). Its nets are flattened to M1.<net> unless a port merges them into a
# board-level net.
